              <description>Select ACOMP1 positive hysteresis voltage level. 1'h0 No hysteresis 1'h1 +10 mV hysteresis 0x2 +20 mV hysteresis 0x3 +30 mV hysteresis 0x4 +40 mV hysteresis 0x5 +50 mV hysteresis 0x6 +60 mV hysteresis 0x7 +70 mV hysteresis</description>
